Ever since he was afflicted with the [[Curse of the Legendary Titans]], [[the Professor]] had been using a power akin to Thoughtspecter to hide the effects of the curse on his body. {{source|The Divine Comedy}}

[[Zhalia Moon]] learnt the spell from the power from [[Jason's tablet]] on [[Madea Island]]. {{source|The Beautiful Trap}} 

Zhalia used the spell right away to create a clone of [[Lindorm]] and distract the raging Titan, so that [[Lok Lambert]] could send it back to its amulet. {{source|Like Father, Unlike Son}}

In the [[Valley of the Kings, Egypt]], Zhalia used the spell to escape from [[Klaus]]'s forces, masking their escape with an illusion of a sandstorm. {{source|All Work and No Pay}} 

While the team was investigating the [[Castle of Vlad Dracul]], Zhalia used Thoughtspecter to create a duplicate of herself during her duel with [[Sophie Casterwill]]. {{source|The Vampire Loses Its Fangs}}

As Zhalia severed her ties with [[the Organization]], she set her [[Zhalia's apartment|apartment]] to explode and trick the [[Suits]] into believing she died, then used [[Thoughtspecter]] to become invisible and sneak out of the city. {{source|The Unseen Guide}} 

In the desert, after Zhalia had been taken captive by [[the Professor]], she used an illusory spell, presumed by [[Rassimov]] to be Thoughtspecter, to create a blinding yellow aura, allowing herself and the team to escape. {{source|To Be Together}}

While the team travelled to [[Tower of Nostradamus]] in [[Category:France|France]], Zhalia used Thoughtspecter to create decoys of the members in order to evade the [[The Organization's combat choppers]]'s missiles augmented with [[Targetfind]]. {{source|The Tower of Nostradamus}}

At the [[Casterwill Library]] in [[Paris, France|Paris]], Zhalia used Thoughtspecter to conceal her [[Kilthane]], [[Gar-Ghoul]], and [[King Basilisk]] Titans to gain an upper hand against [[Lucas Casterwill]], [[Lane]], and [[Dellix]]. {{source|Chasing Void}}

On [[Medusa's Island]], Thoughtspecter was used by Zhalia so the team could retreat from the [[Blood Spiral]] with [[Medusa]]'s Amulet. {{source|Zhalia's Mission}}

{{Clear}}

